    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpClaude">Claude Anthropic: create the key in Anthropic Console. The claude.ai subscription and the API are separate products.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpCustom">Custom provider: use the URL, model, and API key specified by that OpenAI-compatible provider.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpGemini">Google Gemini: create the key in Google AI Studio. Gemini Pro/Google AI Pro in the app does not automatically increase API quota or availability; the API has its own tiers and limits.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpGroq">Groq: create the key in GroqCloud Console. It usually offers a free start with usage limits.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpLmStudio">LM Studio local: no API key is needed. Open LM Studio, load a model, and enable the local server in the Developer tab.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpOllama">Ollama local: no API key is needed. Install Ollama, download a model with &apos;ollama pull&apos;, and keep the local service running.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpOpenAI">OpenAI: create the key at platform.openai.com/api-keys. ChatGPT Plus/Pro does not include API usage; the API uses separate billing in the OpenAI Platform.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ProviderHelpOpenRouter">OpenRouter : créez la clé dans OpenRouter. Vous pouvez choisir des modèles gratuits si le modèle se termine par :free ou apparaît comme Free, mais ils ont des limites et une disponibilité variable.</sys:String>
